      <note>DFT-load_ods_vitals_hospital2
Hospital 2 vital signs: sta.sta_vital_signs_hospital2 -&gt; ods.vitals. Run by WF-load_ods, which empties ods.vitals first.
1. NUL: the text NULL becomes empty
2. LKP: code system of each coded column, from ods.source_code_system
3. DCNV: ODS names and types
4. DB_DST: insert into ods.vitals
Red hops: rows DCNV cannot convert, and rows ods.vitals refuses, go to adm.ods_load_reject.</note>
